{"Async functions deleteScheduledEmailReminder and deleteScheduledSMSReminder are called without await inside forEach loop for scheduledReminders, causing database update to set cancelled: true to not complete and errors to not be caught": 0.9118441939353943, "When immediateDelete is true with a referenceId, the function cancels email via SendGrid but never deletes the database record, creating orphaned workflow reminder records": 0.9469695687294006, "CRON job doesn't filter by method: WorkflowMethods.EMAIL when cancelling reminders, causing it to attempt SendGrid API calls for SMS reminders": 0.975203275680542, "Query filtering by cancelled and scheduledDate needs a composite index @@index([cancelled, scheduledDate]) for better performance since CRON job runs every 15 minutes": 0.0786622166633606, "Type Prisma.Prisma__WorkflowReminderClient<WorkflowReminder, never>[] is incorrect - should be Promise<WorkflowReminder>[] or let TypeScript infer it": 0.5682377815246582, "Batch deletion at line 74 will delete ALL reminders including ones whose SendGrid cancellation may have failed, resulting in database records being deleted while SendGrid email is still scheduled": 0.5767819881439209, "Code attempts to cancel email using reminder.referenceId without checking if it's null - referenceId can be null for reminders scheduled more than 72 hours out, causing SendGrid API calls to fail": 0.8906399607658386}